        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Hamilton Decorative Wire Cabinet Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 4 sizes ranging from 3 inches to 12 inches in length, this simple wire hamilton cabinet pull includes all the necessary slotted round head machine screws for installation. It is available in either brass with a brushed nickel finish or bronze with a bronze patina finish. The simplistic design will look just as beautiful in early colonial style homes as it would in more urban style homes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<center>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/hami-112-dimensions.jpg?v=1704442259\" width=\"400\" height=\"446\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Hamilton Wire Cabinet Pull Sizes\">\r\n</center>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>HAMI-DP-112.3:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>HAMI-DP-112.4:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c.: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>HAMI-DP-112.6:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c.: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>HAMI-DP-112.12:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c.: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
